                        <shortname>UpdateEquipmentAllocationPropertiesConfiguration</shortname>
                        <description>Updates extended process properties for the given Equipment Configuration. If none exists, it creates empty ones. The command performs the following checks: 1. if the given Equipment Configuration Id exists, if not error 10300 is returned; 2. if the given Equipment Configuration is not Frozen, if it is error 10992 is returned; 3. if the given AllocationStateMachineNId exists, if not error 11210 is returned.</description>
